    kind: work_item  # 98e1
    title: "java receiver typing misses four ordinary shapes (static-factory chain, var from a static factory, fully-qualified parameter type, new X(..).m()), so catalogued method rows reached that way cannot match"  # 98e1
    status: todo_hard  # 98e1
    priority: 2  # 98e1
    parent:  # 98e1
    tags:  # 98e1
    - taint  # 98e1
