  nonce: d41e  # d41e
  message: "WORK DONE 2026-10-01 (concurrent run, local branch jgstern-agent/fix/halin, NOT pushed): commits fd4a86d68a (fix) + ec0357a01b (ADR-0006 java row).\n\nPREMISE: all four shapes re-reproduced on dev 8cfcab7b07 before any change (hidar fixtures + a constructor-sink fixture, verify-claims plaintext -> host_fs): j_chain / j_var inconclusive 0 findings, j_fq confirmed_with_caveats 0, j_new inconclusive [untyped_receiver, unknown_receiver_scope] 0; j_local control violated 1.\n\nTWO ADDITIONAL ROOT CAUSES FOUND:\n(a) library_signatures/java.yaml keyed EVERY row by the short owner (Socket.getOutputStream) while java.py looks rows up by the owner path the calling file establishes (java.net.Socket.getOutputStream). All 19 shipped java rows were inert on the production path; the WI-lalot java test passed only because its local was DECLARED Connection. Re-keyed to fq owners; added javax.crypto.Cipher.getInstance.\n(b) java.py Case 1 (current-class lookup) and the static-import arm fired for ANY receiver expression (receiver_name None): new FileOutputStream(p).write(pt) inside a class with its own write() became a RESOLVED call to that write() and the sink edge vanished; x.y().startsWith(..) took a static-imported hamcrest module. Both now apply to a bare call / this only (Case 1 also super, unchanged).\n\nFIX: chain walk (_call_return_type) rooted at a typed var, this/bare, a constructor or a static type; one var-binding arm from it; scoped_type_identifier parameters; constructor receivers carry their written type (and keep WI-tusav's stream-origin stamp); var from a qualified/generic constructor binds.\n\nAFTER (same fixtures, branch code): j_chain, j_var, j_fq, j_new all violated with 1 finding, = j_local.\n\nTESTS: smart-test affected selection, 415 files: 12761 passed, 3 xfailed, changed source files at 100% coverage.\n\nA/B (dev 8cfcab7b07 vs branch, survey + io-boundaries, jenkins): java catalogued io edges 1887 -> 1928 (+41, none lost): File.exists +20, URL.openConnection +4, File.listFiles +4, Runtime.exec 0 -> 3, Runtime.availableProcessors 0 -> 2, 8 others +1. Call sites: 731 external -> typed module; 17 typed -> external, all 17 read back as corrections (static-import misattribution x13, a Case-1 false binding to java.util.Locale x2, a Map now typed as the constructed project class x2). Generic constructors now narrow the declared type (List -> ArrayList, 1,163 sites typed -> other typed), by the existing constructor-narrows rule. NOT measured: verify-claims verdict movement on any corpus repo; repos other than jenkins and confluent-examples.\n\nRESIDUALS FILED: WI-hatov-tijuj-vigup-tulul-hogin-hojon-jonak-bozif (super.m() resolves to the override itself), WI-buhip-gogan-hukal-notib-himuf-ruvas-dukon-huvag (generic/qualified new emits no instantiates edge)."  # d41e
