  message: "DONE: merged in PR #1383 (commits fd75687f03-era fd4d7afd3? see report; batch: run0930 analyzers). The four filed shapes type their receivers on the production path: verify-claims plaintext -> host_fs on the hidar fixtures turns j_chain, j_var and j_fq from inconclusive / confirmed_with_caveats (0 findings) to violated (1 finding), the same as the j_local control; the new FileOutputStream(...).write(pt) sink fixture also reaches violated. Two further root causes fixed: every library_signatures/java.yaml row was keyed by the short owner and never matched; a receiver expression was treated as an implicit this by the current-class and static-import arms. jenkins: catalogued java io edges 1887 -> 1928, none lost. NOT asserted: every java method row reachable for every receiver shape. Residuals: WI-hatov, WI-buhip (P3); casts / array access / literals stay untyped.\nFull report (closure evidence, corpus tables, residual list): /home/jgstern_agent/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/decontend/run_09302026/halin.md"  # 897d
